sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant NextAPI as Next.js API
    participant Auth as Better-Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Okta as Okta IDP
    participant SPN as SPN Token Service
    participant Databricks as Databricks API

    Note over Browser,Databricks: SSO-SPN Authentication Architecture
    Note over Browser,Databricks: Users authenticate via Okta, API calls use Service Principal

    Browser->>NextAPI: API Request with Session Cookie

    Note over NextAPI,Okta: Step 1: Validate User Session (Okta SSO)
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate User Session
    Auth->>DB: Get User Session
    DB-->>Auth: User + Organization Context

    opt Validate Okta Token
        Auth->>Okta: Verify user token
        Okta-->>Auth: Token valid
    end

    Auth-->>NextAPI: SessionContext { userId, orgId, ... }

    Note over NextAPI,DB: Step 2: Get Organization's Service Principal
    NextAPI->>DB: Query organization SPN config
    DB-->>NextAPI: SPN clientId + encrypted secret

    Note over NextAPI,Databricks: Step 3: Get/Refresh SPN Token
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN access token

    alt SPN Token Missing or Expired
        SPN->>SPN: Decrypt client secret (AES-256-GCM)
        SPN->>Databricks: POST /oidc/v1/token<br/>grant_type=client_credentials
        Note right of SPN: client_id + client_secret
        Databricks-->>SPN: Access Token (1 hour TTL)
        SPN->>SPN: Encrypt token for storage
        SPN->>DB: Cache SPN token (encrypted)
    end

    SPN-->>NextAPI: SPN Access Token

    Note over NextAPI,Databricks: Step 4: Make API Call as Service Principal
    NextAPI->>Databricks: API Request<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
    Databricks->>Databricks: Validate SPN permissions
    Databricks-->>NextAPI: Response
    NextAPI-->>Browser: Data

    Note over Browser,Databricks: Key Benefits
    Note right of Databricks: - Users don't need Databricks accounts<br/>- Centralized permission management<br/>- Audit trail per organization<br/>- Easy user onboarding via Okta
